    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes a correlated Kluge - extended Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process governed by <formula id="133">\[ \begin{array}{rcl} P_t &amp;=&amp; \exp(p_t + X_t + Y_t) \\ dX_t &amp;=&amp; -\alpha X_tdt + \sigma_x dW_t^x \\ dY_t &amp;=&amp; -\beta Y_{t-}dt + J_tdN_t \\ \omega(J) &amp;=&amp; \eta e^{-\eta J} \\ G_t &amp;=&amp; \exp(g_t + U_t) \\ dU_t &amp;=&amp; -\kappa U_tdt + \sigma_udW_t^u \\ \rho &amp;=&amp; \mathrm{corr} (dW_t^x, dW_t^u) \end{array} \]</formula></para><para>References: Kluge, Timo L., 2008. Pricing Swing Options and other Electricity Derivatives, <ulink url="http://eprints.maths.ox.ac.uk/246/1/kluge.pdf">http://eprints.maths.ox.ac.uk/246/1/kluge.pdf</ulink></para><para><ulink url="http://spanderen.de/2011/06/13/vpp-pricing-i-stochastic-processes-partial-integro-differential-equation/">http://spanderen.de/2011/06/13/vpp-pricing-i-stochastic-processes-partial-integro-differential-equation/</ulink> </para>    </detaileddescription>
